asset-packs/stylized_red_rocks/textures/

# Agent/dev scratch (throwaway probe + capture scripts)
_*_tmp.*
**/_*_tmp.test.ts
*.scratch.mjs

# Playwright capture output (tests/visual/__shots__).
#
# WRITE-ONLY, all 93 files of it: every reference in the repo is a
# `page.screenshot({ path })` or a `writeFileSync` — no spec reads one back, and
# there is no `toMatchSnapshot`/`toHaveScreenshot` anywhere, so none of it is a
# pass/fail gate. They are there to be LOOKED at (course art passes, the club
# lab, viewport sweeps) and the *-baseline.json files are diagnostic dumps of
# whatever machine last ran.
#
# Tracking them meant every suite run dirtied the tree with 43MB of rebaked
# pixels, and committing that recorded one container's timings as if they were
# the reference. Regenerate on demand with `npx playwright test`.
tests/visual/__shots__/
